{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "tabatine-webhook-collection",
    "name": "Tabatine - Omie Webhooks",
    "description": "Collection para testar os endpoints de webhook Omie no Tabatine Engine.\n\nEndpoint único: POST /webhook/omie\n\nHandlers suportados:\n- ClienteFornecedor (Incluido, Alterado, Excluido)\n- VendaProduto (Incluida, Alterada, Cancelada, Devolvida, EtapaAlterada, Excluida, Faturada)\n- Produto (Incluido, Alterado, Excluido, MovimentacaoEstoque, AjusteEstoque)\n- Vendedor (Incluido, Alterado, Excluido)\n- Financas.ContaCorrente (Incluido, Alterado, Excluido)\n- NFe (NotaAutorizada, NotaCancelada, NotaDevolucaoAutorizada)\n- NFSe (NotaAutorizada, NotaCancelada, NotaSubstituida)\n- Faturamento.NotaFiscalEmitida (legado)\n- System.ManualSync (via /api/sync/trigger)",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:5000",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "URL base do Tabatine Worker"
    },
    {
      "key": "appKey",
      "value": "{{OMIE_APP_KEY}}",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "App Key da Omie"
    },
    {
      "key": "appHash",
      "value": "{{OMIE_APP_HASH}}",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "App Hash/Secret da Omie"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "ClienteFornecedor",
      "description": "Eventos de Cliente/Fornecedor. Handler: ClienteWebhookHandler → ClienteSyncService.SyncByIdAsync",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "ClienteFornecedor.Incluido",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"appKey\": \"{{appKey}}\",\n  \"appHash\": \"{{appHash}}\",\n  \"event\": \"ClienteFornecedor.Incluido\",\n  \"author\": \"Omie\",\n  \"message\": {\n    \"codigo_cliente_omie\": 123456789\n  }\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/webhook/omie",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["webhook", "omie"]
            },
            "description": "Simula a inclusão de um novo Cliente/Fornecedor na Omie.\n\n1. Grava na tabela WebhookEvents (Pending)\n2. Retorna 200 OK (Fast Acknowledge)\n3. Background Worker chama ClienteSyncService.SyncByIdAsync\n4. Envia notificação 'Novo Cliente/Fornecedor'"
          },
          "response": [{ "name": "200 OK", "status": "OK", "code": 200, "body": "" }]
        },
        {
          "name": "ClienteFornecedor.Alterado",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"appKey\": \"{{appKey}}\",\n  \"appHash\": \"{{appHash}}\",\n  \"event\": \"ClienteFornecedor.Alterado\",\n  \"author\": \"Omie\",\n  \"message\": {\n    \"codigo_cliente_omie\": 123456789\n  }\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/webhook/omie",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["webhook", "omie"]
            },
            "description": "Simula a alteração de um Cliente/Fornecedor existente na Omie."
          },
          "response": [{ "name": "200 OK", "status": "OK", "code": 200, "body": "" }]
        },
        {
          "name": "ClienteFornecedor.Excluido",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"appKey\": \"{{appKey}}\",\n  \"appHash\": \"{{appHash}}\",\n  \"event\": \"ClienteFornecedor.Excluido\",\n  \"author\": \"Omie\",\n  \"message\": {\n    \"codigo_cliente_omie\": 123456789\n  }\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/webhook/omie",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["webhook", "omie"]
            },
            "description": "Simula a exclusão de um Cliente/Fornecedor na Omie."
          },
          "response": [{ "name": "200 OK", "status": "OK", "code": 200, "body": "" }]
        }
      ]
    },
